Regional Outlook
North America was the largest market in 2025, accounting for roughly 45–50% of global sales.
Europe remains an important premium market because of strong design heritage, environmental standards, and demand for high-efficiency combustion systems.
Other regions are developing around premium residential construction, renovation projects, and demand for efficient heating solutions.
